  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Teacher Capacity Building with AI and Digital Technologies: E-library for teachers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is aimed to support the ongoing growth and capacity building of teachers in the era of smart learning by fully unleashing the potential of ICT and Artificial Intelligence (AI). The key outcomes of the Project will be a platform with up-to-date digital resources and educational materials, capacity building activities for teachers, and strong partnership network. The Project will contribute to achieving SDG 4 for education and particularly meeting Target 4.c by providing teachers and teaching with open educational resources, free public tools as well as online and onsite trainings, thereby empowering teachers to deliver quality and equitable education.</narrative>
  </description>
